source: tests/cli/snapshots.rs
---
Watch running and pending jobs (live polling)

Usage: vendo jobs watch [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --interval <seconds>           Polling interval in seconds [default: 5]
      --source <sourceId>            Filter by source ID
      --integration <integrationId>  Filter by destination ID
  -h, --help                         Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics

Examples:
  $ vendo jobs watch
  $ vendo jobs watch --source <sourceId>
  $ vendo jobs watch --interval 10
